    "bbox": [
      302.35,
      445.67,
      541.64,
      560.49
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat Mulatiyana on the 29th day of April 2024 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (induplicate) on or before the 22nd day of April 2024, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
